1) To list the available network

  docker network ls

2) To create new network with specific name

  docker network create <NAME>

3) To create network with custom subnet

  docker network --subnet <YOUR-SUBNET_10.0.0.0/16> <NAME>

4) Inspect a docker network

  docker network inspect <network-name or ID>

5) Run a new container and connect to desired docker network

  docker run --network <NETWORK-NAME> <IMAGE-NAME>

6) Connect a running docker container to a Docker network

  docker network connect <NETWORK-NAME> <CONTAINER-NAME>

7) Disconnect running container from docker network

  docker network disconnect <NETWORK-NAME> <CONTAINER-NAME>

  
